{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"凝聚环"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"凝聚环"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称交换环 $A$ <strong>凝聚</strong>是指其任意理想 $I$ 作为 $A$-模有限表现.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}}